@startuml
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1f2937
skinparam ArrowColor #5b6b8c
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1f2937
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #dfe5fb
skinparam NoteBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #5b6b8c
title Dex: admission and settlement

participant Browser as web
participant "Session service" as session
participant "control.sqlite" as cdb
participant "PiG engine" as engine
participant "Bot state.sqlite" as adb

web -> session : POST message with request ID
session -> cdb : Commit input intent
note over web,session
  HTTP 202 confirms acceptance.
  Native admission can still be pending.
end note
session -> engine : Submit with stable request ID
engine -> adb : Commit or reacquire admission
engine --> session : Submission handle
session -> cdb : Mark receipt admitted
note over session,adb
  On first use, the service creates and links a conversation before Submit.
  Reconciliation uses the same request ID after a failed write.
end note
engine --> web : Typed transcript events through live SSE
engine -> adb : Save answer and outcome
engine --> session : Submission.Wait returns outcome
session -> cdb : Settle receipt and queue eligible channel reply
@enduml
